@startuml
title SSD-02: Review Loan Request
actor "Loan Coordinator" as Coordinator
boundary "Community Equipment Loan System" as System
Coordinator -> System: getLoanRequestReviewSummary(coordinatorId, reference)
alt authorised and request exists
  System --> Coordinator: reviewSummary(request, memberEligibility, availabilityEvidence)
else unauthorised / unknown / not reviewable
  System --> Coordinator: reviewUnavailable(reason)
end
@enduml
